WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.816 --> 00:00:12.432
If sagging eyelids give you a tired look or your two eyes are noticeably different sizes, using double-eyelid tape, carefully designed, is highly recommended.

2
00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:17.616
When the artist assesses your eye muscles and places the tape in exactly the right spot,

3
00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:24.960
sagging skin lifts, the hidden crease reappears, and the eyes look noticeably bigger and more defined.

4
00:00:25.296 --> 00:00:31.152
It's such a satisfying result that people often say, "It looks like you had eye surgery," without any surgery at all.

5
00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:34.800
You might worry the tape will be visible,

6
00:00:35.136 --> 00:00:42.720
but it's carefully finished with shadow and liner, so it's barely noticeable at normal distance while still brightening the eyes.

7
00:00:43.056 --> 00:00:48.624
Once uneven eye size is corrected, expressions look much gentler in photos as well.

8
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.056
Double-eyelid glue is sometimes used instead of tape.

9
00:00:52.392 --> 00:01:01.104
Since every pair of eyes is different, using the product suited to each case gives a much better impression, even just from eyes that look naturally bigger and balanced.
